<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - COCA-COLA UPGRADED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - COCA-COLA UPGRADED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs upgraded Coca-Cola Co, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- one source said the firm raised the stock to its recommended list from a market perform rating.</p>
<p>-- the Goldman analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- the shares closed Friday at 62-11/16.</p>
</text>
